1. No imports were removed (api, Button, InputField still there)
2. All functionality preserved (handleLogin, role state, etc.)
3. Only styling and responsive layout improved

### STEP 4: Test Responsive Design

**Mobile Test (< 480px - iPhone SE)**
```
✓ App name visible and readable
✓ "by V.J.P Harvesters" subtitle visible
✓ No text overlapping
